name=Jack of Some Trades
id=JOST
modversion=0.2.2.0
description=Ties trade and crafting skills to the traits and profession picked at character creation. Pips in a skill set both a one-time starting level and a max level cap (0 pips=3, 1=5, 2=7, 3=9, 4+=10). Taking even 1 point in a linked skill (e.g. Cooking/Butchering, Blacksmithing/Welding) raises the paired skill's cap by 1. Four optional training traits (Experienced, Self Taught, Unfinished Education, Blank Slate) tune how much of that starting level you actually begin with, without ever changing the cap. Combat, running, sneaking, and other physical/agility skills are unaffected -- only trade/crafting skills (plus Maintenance) are capped. Built for Project Zomboid Build 42 multiplayer, where every character otherwise ends up maxing every craft skill regardless of backstory.
